---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="大腸與直腸 3D 互動解剖暨內視鏡巡航系統 | 互動解剖圖鑑 - 黃冠智醫師" 
  description="大腸直腸 3D 空間立體解剖系統。包含大腸鏡進鏡深度模擬（0-100cm）、息肉/憩室/痔瘡病灶標記、結腸袋構造與各腸段病歷片語產生器。"
  fullWidth={true}
  hideFooter={true}
>
  <!-- Three.js CDN dependencies -->
  <script is:inline src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tween.js/18.6.4/tween.umd.js"></script>

  <div class="colon-app-wrapper" id="colonAppWrapper">
    <!-- Subheader with breadcrumb & action controls -->
    <div class="anatomy-subnav">
      <div class="subnav-left">
        <a href="/anatomy" class="back-link">
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          <span>返回圖鑑總覽</span>
        </a>
        <div class="divider">/</div>
        <div class="current-badge">
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
          <span>大腸與直腸 (Colon & Rectum 3D 實體模型)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="subnav-right">
        <!-- Fullscreen Button -->
        <button class="btn btn-fullscreen" id="btn-fullscreen-toggle" onclick="toggleFullScreen()" title="進入/退出全螢幕診間衛教模式">
          <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" id="icon-fs"><path d="M8 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3m18 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3m0 18h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3M3 16v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3"/></svg>
          <span id="txt-fs-label">全螢幕模式</span>
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline" id="btn-toggle-quiz" onclick="toggleQuizMode()">
          <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"/></svg>
          3D 測驗模式
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="reset3DCamera()">
          <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
          重設視角
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main 3-Column Workspace Grid -->
    <div class="workspace-grid">
      
      <!-- Left Panel: Scope Navigation, Pathologies & Controls -->
      <div class="glass-panel left-panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <div class="panel-title">
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 14c0 3.5 3 6 8 6s8-2.5 8-6-3-6-8-6-8 2.5-8 6Z"/><path d="M6 10V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4"/></svg>
            大腸鏡巡航與病灶標記
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="panel-body">
          
          <!-- Cutaway Mode Toggle Button -->
          <div class="control-row mode-switch-card">
            <div class="section-label" style="color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
              解剖視野模式 (ANATOMICAL VIEW)
            </div>
            <div class="view-mode-buttons">
              <button class="btn btn-mode active" id="btn-mode-cutaway" onclick="setViewMode('cutaway')">
                <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 3v18"/></svg>
                內部管腔剖面 (Cutaway 視野)
              </button>
              <button class="btn btn-mode" id="btn-mode-full" onclick="setViewMode('full')">
                <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg>
                完整 3D 腸道外觀
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="view-mode-hint">
              💡 剖面模式可透視<strong>內部結腸袋管腔</strong>與大腸鏡推進及內壁息肉。
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Endoscopy Scope Navigation Slider (0 - 100 cm) -->
          <div class="control-row scope-card">
            <div class="control-label-group">
              <span style="color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;">
                <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8"/></svg>
                大腸鏡進鏡深度 (Scope Depth)
              </span>
              <span id="txt-scope-cm" class="scope-cm-badge">0 cm</span>
            </div>
            <input type="range" id="slider-scope" min="0" max="100" value="0" step="1" oninput="onScopeSlider(this.value)">
            <div class="scope-milestones">
              <span>肛門 (0cm)</span>
              <span>乙狀結腸 (35cm)</span>
              <span>脾曲 (55cm)</span>
              <span>盲腸 (100cm)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="scope-status-box" id="scope-status-box">
              <span class="scope-status-icon">📍</span>
              <span id="scope-status-text">內視鏡位於肛門口，準備進入直腸。</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pathology Marker Toggles (息肉 / 憩室 / 痔瘡) -->
          <div class="control-row">
            <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0.45rem;">
              常見病灶標記 (點擊在 3D 腸道顯示)
            </div>
            <div class="pathology-btn-group">
              <button class="btn btn-pathology" id="btn-path-polyp" onclick="togglePathology('polyp')">
                <span class="path-dot dot-polyp"></span>
                大腸息肉 (Polyps)
              </button>
              <button class="btn btn-pathology" id="btn-path-diverticulum" onclick="togglePathology('diverticulum')">
                <span class="path-dot dot-diverticulum"></span>
                大腸憩室 (Diverticula)
              </button>
              <button class="btn btn-pathology" id="btn-path-hemorrhoid" onclick="togglePathology('hemorrhoid')">
                <span class="path-dot dot-hemorrhoid"></span>
                痔瘡 (Hemorrhoids)
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="pathology-info-text" id="pathology-info-text">
              點選上方按鈕可即時切換病灶位置與臨床處置說明。
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3D Explode Slider -->
          <div class="control-row">
            <div class="control-label-group">
              <span>3D 腸段立體炸開 (Explosion)</span>
              <span id="txt-explode-val" class="slider-val">0%</span>
            </div>
            <input type="range" id="slider-explode" min="0" max="100" value="0" oninput="onExplodeSlider(this.value)">
            <div class="slider-subtext">
              <span>0% (緊密天然走向)</span>
              <span>100% (完全炸開)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tissue Opacity Slider -->
          <div class="control-row">
            <div class="control-label-group">
              <span>腸壁透明度 (Wall Opacity)</span>
              <span id="txt-opacity-val" class="slider-val">90%</span>
            </div>
            <input type="range" id="slider-opacity" min="20" max="100" value="90" oninput="onOpacitySlider(this.value)">
            <div class="slider-subtext-single">
              調低透明度可透視內部管腔與大腸鏡推進路徑
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Segment List -->
          <div class="section-label">
            點選解剖腸段 (COLONIC SEGMENTS)
          </div>
          <div class="segment-grid-list">
            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('rectum')" id="btn-seg-rectum">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">0~15cm</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">盆腔最底</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">直腸與肛門 (Rectum)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('sigmoid')" id="btn-seg-sigmoid">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">15~40cm</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">彎曲拉扯區</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">乙狀結腸 (Sigmoid)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('descending')" id="btn-seg-descending">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">40~55cm</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">左側腹後壁</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">降結腸與脾曲 (Descending)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('transverse')" id="btn-seg-transverse">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">55~80cm</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">上腹游離段</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">橫結腸 (Transverse)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('ascending')" id="btn-seg-ascending">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">80~95cm</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">右側腹後壁</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">升結腸與肝曲 (Ascending)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('cecum')" id="btn-seg-cecum">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">95~100+cm</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">檢查終點標記</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">盲腸與闌尾 (Cecum)</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Center Stage: Three.js True 3D Colorectal WebGL Canvas -->
      <div class="glass-panel canvas-panel">
        <!-- Preset View Angles Toolbar -->
        <div class="view-angles-toolbar">
          <button class="view-btn active" id="view-btn-anterior" onclick="setPresetView('anterior')">正面全覽 (Anterior)</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-left-colon" onclick="setPresetView('left_colon')">左側大腸觀 (直腸/乙狀/降結)</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-right-colon" onclick="setPresetView('right_colon')">右側盲腸觀 (升結/盲腸/闌尾)</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-splenic" onclick="setPresetView('splenic')">脾曲高位視角</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-pelvis" onclick="setPresetView('pelvis')">骨盆底直腸仰視</button>
        </div>

        <!-- ThreeJS Canvas Container -->
        <div id="threejs-canvas-container"></div>

        <!-- Orbit Controls Guidance Hint -->
        <div class="orbit-hint">
          <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8"/></svg>
          <span><strong>滑鼠左鍵拖曳</strong>：360° 真 3D 空間自由旋轉 ｜ <strong>滾輪</strong>：拉近縮放 ｜ <strong>滑動進鏡深度</strong>：模擬內視鏡推進</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Panel: Clinical Information & Endoscopy Guide -->
      <div class="glass-panel right-panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <div class="panel-title">
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
            大腸鏡判讀與臨床指引
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="panel-body" id="detail-panel">
          
          <!-- Header Title Info -->
          <div class="detail-title-group">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">
              <span id="det-pill" class="seg-badge-pill">15 ~ 40 cm</span>
              <span id="det-sector" class="sector-tag">Left Lower Quadrant (Sigmoid)</span>
            </div>
            <div id="det-title-zh" class="main-title">乙狀結腸 (Sigmoid Colon)</div>
            <div id="det-title-en" class="sub-title">Colon sigmoideum · Pelvic Intestinal Loop</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Metric Grid -->
          <div class="metric-grid">
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">常規進鏡距離</div>
              <div id="det-distance" class="metric-value">15 ～ 40 cm</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">內視鏡操作難度</div>
              <div id="det-difficulty" class="metric-value">高 (易扭曲成環/Loop)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">息肉好發類型</div>
              <div id="det-polyp-type" class="metric-value">腺瘤 (Tubular)、增生性</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">常見疾病好發</div>
              <div id="det-disease" class="metric-value">大腸憩室、息肉、憩室炎</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Endoscopy Pearls -->
          <div class="surgical-pearls" id="det-pearls-box">
            <strong>大腸鏡檢查重點：</strong> 乙狀結腸由腸繫膜懸吊，活動度極大且彎曲度最高。檢查過程中最常產生拉扯感（Looping），熟練的內視鏡醫師會透過「抽吸氣（De-aeration）」與「右旋後拉（Right torque & hook）」技術解環，以無痛安全通過。
          </div>

          <!-- Ultrasound & Endoscopic Clinical Pearls -->
          <div class="detail-card">
            <h3>
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
              內視鏡判讀與衛教指引 (Clinical Pearls)
            </h3>
            <div id="det-pearls-list">
              <div class="pearl-item">
                <svg width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>大腸癌與息肉好發區</strong>：統計上超過 50% 以上的大腸腺瘤與大腸癌好發於乙狀結腸與直腸（左側大腸）。</span>
              </div>
              <div class="pearl-item">
                <svg width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>微創冷剪/電燒切除 (Polypectomy)</strong>：檢查當下若發現息肉，可立即透過內視鏡切除並送病理化驗，阻斷癌變途徑。</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Automatic Medical Phrase Generator -->
          <div class="phrase-box">
            <div class="phrase-header">
              <span class="phrase-title">大腸鏡檢查報告片語 (點擊即複製)</span>
              <button class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.18rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.68rem;" onclick="copyPhrase()">複製片語</button>
            </div>
            <div id="det-phrase-text" class="phrase-content">
              Colonoscopy: Total colonoscopy to cecum. A 0.6cm sessile polyp noted at Sigmoid colon (approx. 25cm from anal verge), successfully removed by cold snare polypectomy.
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Toast Notification -->
  <div id="toast">
    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
    <span id="toast-msg">已複製片語至剪貼簿！</span>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    // Colorectal Anatomical Knowledge Database
    const colonData = {
      rectum: {
        titleZh: '直腸與肛門 (Rectum & Anus)',
        titleEn: 'Rectum & Canalis analis',
        distance: '0 ～ 15 cm',
        difficulty: '低 (進鏡起點與倒轉觀察 Retroflexion)',
        polypType: '管狀腺瘤 (Tubular)、神經內分泌腫瘤 (NET)',
        disease: '內外痔瘡、直腸炎、早期直腸癌、潰瘍',
        sector: 'Pelvic Cavity / Perineum',
        pearlsBox: '<strong>大腸鏡檢查重點：</strong> 直腸長度約 12-15 cm，內有 3 個休斯頓橫襞（Houston valves）。進鏡起點與退鏡時必須於直腸壺腹（Rectal ampulla）進行 <strong>倒轉觀察（U-turn / Retroflexion）</strong>，以防漏看肛門齒狀線邊緣之微小病灶或痔瘡。',
        pearls: [
          '<strong>齒狀線 (Dentate line)</strong>：為內痔（無痛神經）與外痔（劇痛神經）之解剖分界線。',
          '<strong>下消化道上皮下腫瘤好發</strong>：直腸是消化道類癌（NET / Carcinoid）最常偶發發現之部位。'
        ],
        phrase: 'Colonoscopy: Rectum shows smooth mucosa with mild internal hemorrhoids on retroflexion view. No ulcerative lesion.'
      },
      sigmoid: {
        titleZh: '乙狀結腸 (Sigmoid Colon)',
        titleEn: 'Colon sigmoideum',
        distance: '15 ～ 40 cm',
        difficulty: '高 (易扭曲成環 / Looping 處)',
        polypType: '腺瘤性息肉 (Adenoma)、增生性息肉',
        disease: '大腸憩室 (Diverticula)、大腸息肉、憩室炎、腺癌',
        sector: 'Left Lower Quadrant (Pelvis)',
        pearlsBox: '<strong>大腸鏡檢查重點：</strong> 乙狀結腸由長繫膜懸吊，管徑較窄且轉折劇烈，為檢查中最易引起腹脹或疼痛之處。專業醫師採取「短縮法與右旋後拉（Right-torque withdrawal）」能將腸道套疊拉直，減少受檢者不適。',
        pearls: [
          '<strong>大腸癌與息肉第一好發段</strong>：臨床約 50% 大腸惡性腫瘤集中於乙狀結腸與直腸。',
          '<strong>大腸憩室好發區</strong>：長期便秘與排便壓力常導致乙狀結腸黏膜向外突出形成憩室。'
        ],
        phrase: 'Colonoscopy: Sigmoid colon shows multiple tiny diverticula without active bleeding or inflammation. A 0.5cm polyp removed by cold snare.'
      },
      descending: {
        titleZh: '降結腸與脾曲 (Descending Colon & Splenic Flexure)',
        titleEn: 'Colon descendens & Flexura coli sinistra',
        distance: '40 ～ 55 cm',
        difficulty: '中 (脾曲為全大腸最高轉折點)',
        polypType: '管狀腺瘤、鋸齒狀病灶',
        disease: '缺血性腸炎 (Ischemic colitis)、黑腸症、息肉',
        sector: 'Left Flank / Subphrenic Area',
        pearlsBox: '<strong>大腸鏡檢查重點：</strong> 降結腸為腹膜後固定器官，直行向上抵達脾曲（Splenic flexure）。脾曲為全結腸最高點且鄰近脾臟，進鏡時需溫和調整角度，配合病患深吸氣或左側臥位以順利跨越。',
        pearls: [
          '<strong>缺血性腸炎好發（Griffith\'s point）</strong>：脾曲為腸繫膜上動脈與下動脈末梢交界處（分水嶺區），老年人低血壓時易引發缺血性結腸炎。',
          '<strong>脾曲解剖標誌</strong>：透過管壁可隱約透視深青藍色的脾臟陰影。'
        ],
        phrase: 'Colonoscopy: Descending colon and splenic flexure were successfully traversed with clear mucosal visualization.'
      },
      transverse: {
        titleZh: '橫結腸 (Transverse Colon)',
        titleEn: 'Colon transversum',
        distance: '55 ～ 80 cm',
